WEBVTT

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.790
Welcome!

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.750
Which cake would you like?

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.120
The usual, this one and this one please.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.580
Understood!

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.500
Hey, Cacao!

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.870
How are you?

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:19.370
--Let's play.
--Oh, sorry, Cacao.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:22.500
I have to go home right away today.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.040
Please enjoy while it's fresh.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.330
Yes, thank you as always.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.120
Chiyo, let's go.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:32.290
Yeah, one second.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.830
I know, Cacao! You can come
to my house one of these days!

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.870
Then we can play a lot!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.410
Hmm? What is it, Cacao?

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.580
Hungry?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.370
I want to go.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:52.580
Go where?

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.660
Chiyo's house.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.160
What?!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:59.660
You don't even have a bell yet,
how are you going to get there?

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.330
You might get lost again!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.450
Oh, that sounds good!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.330
You're always welcome anytime!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.000
Why don't you come sleep over next holiday?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.950
Thanks, Mom!

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.450
Cacao, will you come sleep over?

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.080
C-Cacao...

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.040
A sleepover?!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:24.040
You see? These are your pajamas,
and new underwear.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:27.410
Also, toothbrush, toothpaste.

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:31.370
A hot water bottle and a body warmer
just in case it gets cold.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:36.330
Alarm clock, ready. Bath set, good to go.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.870
As for the dried fish, I have
a dozen business-use packages.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.330
"Dried Fish"
As for the dried fish, I have
a dozen business-use packages.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.370
Also... Also...

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:44.250
Oh! Here it is!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:49.620
Here's Mr. Bear! He was Chocola's
favorite when Chocola was small.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.040
If you feel lonely, you can
think about Chocola and hug him!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.200
Do we have everything?

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:00.290
Don't worry, I sewed our contact
information on the backpack!

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:03.000
Yes! Vanilla, always so reliable!

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.500
Phew. Is this good enough?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.160
--Cacao!
--Hey, hey, come on, guys.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.950
Cacao's just spending one night, right?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.870
She doesn't need that much stuff.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:26.000
No, that's not accurate, Master!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:31.370
This is the perfect sleepover set,
with every contingency in mind!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.370
Yes!

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.580
You're exaggerating...

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.620
Besides, she can't carry that much...

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.580
Yes...

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:44.250
I'm sorry.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:52.080
Cacao! Over here!

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:54.540
Welcome!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:57.450
Thank you for allowing Cacao to stay with you.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.910
I hope she isn't too much trouble for you.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.870
Of course, I'm happy to have her here.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.790
Whoa... Shigure-<i>chan </i>is being a grown-up...

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.000
We must follow her lead...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:15.000
Ahem... I hope Cacao is
too much trouble for you.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.500
Huh? Too much?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.290
No, Chocola, you mean "not" too much trouble.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.330
Yes, not too much trouble.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.750
Oh, of course! Don't mention it.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.910
"Shigure Minaduki"
This is my contact information.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:32.660
Please don't hesitate to call me for any reason.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.620
I understand.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:38.540
Cacao, make sure you find out
where the toilet is right away.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:42.870
Don't forget to say thank you
for the food after dinner.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.290
Yes.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.950
Is she going to be all right?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:50.620
Don't worry, Cacao is a smart kitten.
I assure you she'll be okay.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:54.290
Oh, I know. Take this, Cacao.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:06:00.750
Not yet. Read it first thing
after you get inside the house.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:04.000
Let's go, Cacao.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.000
Yes.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:10.700
--Oh...
--Cacao...

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.790
Let's go, both of you.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.250
B-But...

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.120
Still worried...

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.120
They say, if you love your child,
you have to let them see the world.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:23.950
I think this is a great chance
for Cacao to learn and grow.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:28.120
Three shortcakes. Would that be all?

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.040
We're home.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.200
Welcome back.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.160
How was it? Was it a tear-jerking,
melodramatic separation?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.370
O-Of course not!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:42.870
Really? Are you sure you didn't wave at her,
crying about never letting her go?

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:47.160
It would be cute if Chocola did that, though!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:51.080
No! Chocola is no longer a baby!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:55.000
Both Chocola and I can spend
one night away from Cacao...

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.500
Huh, the cacao...

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.160
We've run out of cacao beans.
Can someone refill this?

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.870
O-Oh, right...

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.370
For a moment I thought Cacao came back...

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:09.580
You two totally haven't let go of her at all...

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:11.910
Here you are.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:16.200
You can relax like this is
your own house, Cacao.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.500
What's that, Cacao?

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.910
"Hello, my name is Cacao.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:32.000
I hope my presence here
does not inconvenience you."

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.250
"Kaminari-Okoshi"
Please take this as a token of my gratitude.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.540
Oh, Kaminari-Okoshi. Thank you!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.200
Wow, Cacao! You're such a grown-up!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:47.160
So, this Fondant Chocomeow...

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.950
Chocola, you're tripping on words.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:49.910
Oh...

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.750
Th-Three Fonmewo Chocomeow...

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:55.950
Three Fondant Chocolats coming up.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.700
Vanilla!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.120
Too many!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.500
Oh... I've let my attention slip.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.160
Excuse us! We'll fix this right away!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.870
Are they okay?

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.700
They must be concerned about Cacao.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:11.000
How cute.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.910
They're still kittens after all.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.370
Over here, Cacao!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.450
Boo!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.580
What are you making, Cacao?

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:27.620
Dried fish.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:30.330
I... see. Very big.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.290
Need help with something?

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:37.290
Yes, get me the bowls.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.410
Okay.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.250
Let's see, bowls...

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.250
What's wrong, Chocola?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.450
N-No! It's nothing, Master!

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:58.200
Oh, I forgot that Cacao isn't here.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.910
Today's dish is soy sauce-boiled dried fish.
Your favorites, right?

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:10.120
Cacao loves dried fish, too...
Chocola wonders what Cacao's eating now.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:16.250
Master, please save it until tomorrow.
We'll eat it with Cacao.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.790
O-Oh... Okay.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.200
Yum! Mom's hamburger is great!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:32.120
Oh, Cacao! You eat your veggies properly!

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.620
I'm so glad!

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.370
I'll try, too!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.040
This way.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.950
This is our bath!

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.040
Let's go in together.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.450
Hmm? Cacao, do you not like baths?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:59.330
I see... Oh, I know!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.620
Look, come here, Cacao!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.160
Let's play with these toys together!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.870
Then... Here!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:24.160
Wow, Cacao, you're bold! Do you want to try?

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.000
Wow! Hey!

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.910
How's that? Enough?

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:40.620
Don't sigh, it makes your luck fade away.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.750
Oh, um, right.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.870
H-Hey!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.830
That tickles, Vanilla!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.450
Chocola can do that, too!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.830
Today was a long day.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.370
Chocola?

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:11.040
The bathtub is... bigger than usual.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.700
No, it's the same size.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:18.330
Are you sure?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.410
All done.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.000
"Thanks mom"

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.950
Oh, that's my mother.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.790
Mother...?

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:36.160
I drew it as a present for Mother's Day.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.540
Mom is always working so hard,
so I wanted to thank her.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:44.120
Mom was really happy!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.330
Hey, Vanilla.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.410
What is it, Chocola?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:58.410
The bath, too, but...
The bed is bigger tonight, too.

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:04.250
Yes, I know.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.870
Cacao isn't here.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:12.330
A while ago, you tried so hard
to pretend like everything is normal.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:17.000
I tried to act normal to make sure
you don't get sadder.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.870
Thanks, Vanilla.

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.540
Don't mention it...

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:27.450
Chocola never thought about it this way, but...

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:31.750
Having Cacao nearby has become normal for us.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.160
Yes...

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:37.000
When Cacao comes back,
let's sleep together again.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.450
Of course.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:42.290
But for tonight,
I have Chocola all to myself.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.290
What?

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.200
Vanilla, you're choking Chocola...

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.450
Sorry, can't let go.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:10.870
Thank you very much for
allowing Cacao to stay with you.

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.080
It was our pleasure to have her over.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.750
Please come again, Cacao!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.290
Yes.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.790
Cacao!

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.540
Come to us, now!

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:24.290
Jump into our arms!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.500
Cacao?

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.000
Where are you going?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.540
Cacao?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.750
We're coming in...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.660
"Business Size"
"Dried Fish Pack"
What is this?!

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:41.450
"Business Size"
"Dried Fish Pack"
What is this box...?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.160
Is Cacao in here...?

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.830
Hello?

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.040
What?!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:49.660
No...

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.290
Thank you.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.410
Oh, she must be in what's called
a rebellious phase.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:56.830
Rebellious phase?!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:14:00.700
Nuts used to be so cute when she was smaller.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.660
I'm home.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.830
Big Sis!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.410
Welcome home!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.540
That's how respectful she was of me.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.370
We have never seen...

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.830
...Coconut do that...

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:22.450
Now she's all grown up,
and all that cuteness is gone...

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.870
Hmph!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:27.700
Cacao is preparing to grow up as well.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:32.200
You should leave her alone,
don't force yourselves into her life.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.700
Really...?

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.410
Is that right...?

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.040
Excuse us...

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.450
Though this is our own room...

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.830
She's still doing something inside.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:56.250
We must successfully enter
into conversation with Cacao.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.870
Miss Cacao?

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:04.450
Be a good girl and come out?

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:14.830
Did she forget who we are just by
spending one night away from us...?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:19.290
That's impossible...

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:25.620
We'll bring everyone in on this,
and have Cacao come out no matter what!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:32.200
Come and get some fresh cooked saury.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.120
It's hard to find them this time of the year.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.790
--No.
--Ouch!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:44.250
My eyes are getting
really itchy for some reason.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.200
You're just imagining it.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.580
Let's cook it more
and make it smell better...

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.700
Whoa, what are you doing?!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.620
It's full of smoke!

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.910
Oh, no! Open the windows!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.830
That was a fail.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.620
We got not only the scent,
but the smoke as well.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:11.540
We almost smoked ourselves.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.080
Guys...

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:17.330
Like I said before, it's just a phase.
Just leave her alone.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.790
That won't fly...

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.700
We're worried about Cacao!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.870
I know! I have a great idea.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.250
Here, May-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.330
What's this?

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.410
It's a portable karaoke system.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:33.660
Huh? Why should I sing?

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.660
It's Project Amano-Iwato!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.120
Amano-Iwato?

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:43.580
There's an old story about a goddess
who hid herself behind a big rock.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:49.950
The people got her to come out
by having a fun festival outside.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:53.200
So if we had a big party outside...

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:57.200
Cacao will get curious and come out on her own!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:59.700
What kind of fairy tale is this?

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:03.500
Please, May-<i>chan</i>!
Help us with your fantastic voice!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.660
I want to hear!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.200
Ugh... Fine.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:15.120
♪ One flight on a broom,
in the dark night ♪

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:21.500
♪ Deliver many stars to you,
so just sit tight ♪

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.330
--♪ A secret spell,
let's cast it together ♪

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:26.750
--Oh, I'm getting moist!
--♪ A secret spell,
let's cast it together ♪

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.040
--What are you getting all aroused for?!
--♪ A secret spell,
let's cast it together ♪

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.790
♪ Meow! Two... ♪

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:31.830
Cacao!

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:32.870
Shush.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.200
Oh, no!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.370
It can't be...

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.120
Even I was kind of hurt...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.040
Come on, enough already!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.500
You all understand now,
just leave her alone.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.410
Yes...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.290
So Cacao still won't come out?

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.910
Yes, she's been in there since morning...

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:56.540
Still in that box.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:18:02.750
What's going on?
She's never missed a meal before.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.080
Soy sauce-boiled dried fish!

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:09.540
Yes, with this favorite dish of hers...

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.910
...her hunger should surely...!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:16.000
Master! Please go ahead and eat without us!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.290
We will take care of Cacao!

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.950
Yeah, go ahead.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.080
Miss Cacao?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.540
Getting hungry yet?

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.410
Here's Master's hand-made
soy sauce-boiled dried fish.

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:34.950
Look, it's your favorite, Cacao!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.500
Oh, no!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.450
Only the plate came back...

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:49.700
What to do... Is there
nothing we can do but wait?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:55.870
Chocola, I think we've
come down to the final option.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:19:02.250
Y-Yes... Azu-<i>nyan </i>told us to
leave her alone, but we're worried, so...

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.790
The only thing we can do is...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:05.540
...enter by force!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.410
Here we go!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:13.790
Ow...

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.250
Cacao!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.250
We were so worried!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.910
What happened?!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.750
"To Chocola and Vanilla.

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:29.370
Thank you for always playing with me."

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:35.830
"When I am bored,

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:39.040
you played with me using a ball.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:43.700
Or using a cat teaser. Thank you."

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.910
"Thank you for showing me the ocean.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:54.330
It was very big and I was surprised.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:59.830
Thank you for taking me to
the amusement park.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:02.200
It was very fun."

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:10.040
"Thank you for letting me eat
lots of moving sushi. It was delicious."

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:15.950
"Thank you for saying
you want me to stay with you here.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:19.870
I was very happy.

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:21.290
Thank you."

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.160
Cacao...

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.000
For us?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.080
This...

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:46.200
For us...?

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:52.290
Chocola, Vanilla, I love you.

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.870
We'll always be together.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.040
Cacao!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.410
Thank you.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.660
Chocola loves you, too!

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.910
Yes, we really will always be together!

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:21.950
"Illustration by Poyoyon Rock (Front Wing)
"Please watch again!"
